# 8. Proof of Concept (PoC)

A malicious JavaScript file was uploaded to the Exploit Server:

```text
/resources/js/tracking.js
```

with the following content:

```javascript
alert(document.cookie);
```

Once the poisoned response was cached, every user requesting the homepage automatically loaded the malicious JavaScript from the attacker's server, resulting in arbitrary script execution.

